  name: Strength Forge
  minigameType: 61
  instructionsLabel: Forge a password that survives every attack
  resultOnTimeout: 0
  standardDuration: 180
  minigameUIPrefab: {fileID: 3675746425103579868, guid: a261a01bfee48574087b1a5f0756183a, type: 3}
  descriptionImage: {fileID: 0}
  descriptionHeader: Strength Forge
  description: 'Forge a password for each account by combining tokens from the pool.
    Watch the attack meters - your password must survive every active attack for
    the required time before you can commit it with FORGE.



    Rare words are
    strong but expensive to remember - spend your memorability budget wisely. Breach-dump
    fragments and leet-speak look tempting, but crackers try those first.'
